    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n25376" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">διανέω</span></b> , <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>swim across,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐς Σαλαμῖνα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Hdt.
					8.89
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὸν Τίγρητα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Luc.
					<u>Hist. Conscr.</u>
					19
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b> c. acc.,
				<i>swim through,</i> i.e. <i>get safe through,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">δ. πέλαγος λόγων</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Pl.
					<u>Prm.</u>
					137a
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				<u>R.</u>
				441c
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ποταμόν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Ael.
					<u>NA</u>
					3.6
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>III.</b> metaph. in 
				Med.
			, <i>filter through,</i> c. gen., <i><span class="en">
				Marc.Sid.
				76
			</span></i>.</div>
